  "description": "While recuperating from a war injury, Kim Seo-yoon accidentally rescues a young wolf beastman (shapeshifter) in the mountains.\n\nSeo-yoon names him 'Yeon-ho' and takes him in as his son.\n\nYeon-ho, who used to distrust humans, begins to open his heart little by little under Seo-yoon's care, and before long, he starts to look up to Seo-yoon as something more than just a father and a teacher.\n\nThen one day, Seo-yoon accidentally catches Yeon-ho masturbating...\n\n\"Can't you come inside and watch? This part keeps getting hard...\"\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Bomtoon](bomtoon.com/detail/wolfday)",
